By \hyperlink{sga6.e06.cor.4-8}{VI 4.8}, $K^\circ(X)$ is the $K^\circ(S)$-algebra generated by the $\xi_i-1$, subject to the relations deduced from
\[
 \gamma_t(E-n)=\prod_{i=1}^n\gamma_t(\xi_i-1).
\]
